Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2.2\c&H161617&\3c&H161617&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(729,0)\fsp-2\t(687,729,\1a&H00&)}Some Justice
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE7E7E7&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(729,0)\fsp-2}Some Justice
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:02:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our nightmares aren't\Nover, Princess. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish what happened was a\Nnightmare, but it was real!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.81,0:02:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We want justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw King Cobra attack\NNanohana with our own eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those damn royals shot Koza, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect us all just to forgive\Nthem after what they did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our nightmares will only be over once\Nwe've killed every royal in this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.97,0:02:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Royal Army, drop your weapons now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.55,0:02:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.49,0:02:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.79,0:02:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma! Ma! Ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That goes for you too, Rebel Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squad captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May we meet again safely in\Nour homeland, Princess Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.05,0:03:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's that cross-dressing\Nguy from Whiskey Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:25.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, can you talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the boy from Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid who was harmed by\Nthose royal army goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who did this looked\Nlike members of the royal army,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it really wasn't them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.87,0:03:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I saw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to get back into gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were all manipulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This battle was a plot from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yakuza, leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Royal or rebel, I'll\Nexplain it to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything that has\Nbefallen our fair country.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only if you drop your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Usopp, I know\Nyou're hurt, but keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.17,0:04:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could, but I'm coming down with,\Nif I walk anymore, I'll die disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll drag you then. Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me go, or I can come down with, if\NI get dragged anymore, I'll die disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Uh, just\Ntravelers passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guy on your back's one of us as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.87,0:05:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take him now. Thanks, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on if you're with this\Nyoung man then you must
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be those Pirates who brought\NVivi back to this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.41,0:05:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, how would you know\Nall that, Daddy? Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is Phoebe's dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.11,0:05:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess that makes you the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.17,0:05:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd be a dead king if it weren't for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.55,0:05:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the efforts of your\Nbrave young friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he'd come into contact\Nwith Crocodile's poison hook,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still managed to carry\Nmyself and another to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.43,0:05:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An unbelievable strength he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we be worried about the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, is he going to be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.43,0:05:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be neutralized by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, his injuries need to be treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So do yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to be somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go back to the square, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.17,0:06:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the war's over,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.35,0:06:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only fitting for the king and princess\Nto say a few words, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, tell them what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, and I can tell them\Nall about you guys, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.91,0:06:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, dear, please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a band of notorious pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need are\Nour faces and names known.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what we do need is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to crash at the\Npalace, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood, Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.67,0:07:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one behind all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this time, we thought he was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just been informed that a\NBaroque Works ship has been seized,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one that makes artificial\Nrain using dance powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.27,0:07:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You being Baroque Works president,\NI've been ordered to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.13,0:07:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Crocodile, one of the\NSeven Warlords of the Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.15,0:07:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.21,0:07:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me which way Crocodile went!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the authority of the world government,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.35,0:07:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby strip you of your\Nauthorization to capture enemy ships,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.51,0:07:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as all the titles and rights\Nbestowed upon you by the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Additionally, you and all Baroque\NWorks agents are under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's my cue to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We rebels, we've done horrible\Nthings that could never be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.55,0:08:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader, I don't know what to\Nsay to him, to any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all feel regret over what has\Nhappened, but that's natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Cobra, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've lost so much and gained nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we have a chance\Nto take a step forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter who you fought against,\Nthe battle did occur and it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:09:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must put this strife behind\Nus and become one again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's nothing\Nwe can do about what's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing we can change,\Nhowever, and that's our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.25,0:09:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's so wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A future where all of\NAlabasta is united once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monumental battle that will be\Nengraved upon the annals of history...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.19,0:09:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...and even more importantly, the\Nbattle that will never be told...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...is finally over.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.98,0:10:12.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,610)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(480,481)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(438,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4609,4651,\1a&HFF&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}North Coast\NKingdom of Arabasta
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.98,0:10:12.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,610)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(480,481)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}North Coast\NKingdom of Arabasta
Dialogue: 3,0:10:06.98,0:10:12.07,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,610)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(480,481)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}North Coast\NKingdom of Arabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoker, where the hell\Nis this rain coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you used the\Ndance powder on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.55,0:10:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, I know\Nbetter than to commit a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen each\Nother in quite some time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the first thing you do is\Nblame me for some natural rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I was about to tell you you look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.85,0:10:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a lousy welcome. Hina's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for the compliment,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.25,0:10:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe the white hunter\Nwould say something so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.25,0:10:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, you've actually softened up a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap, Hina.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(730,483)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(688,730,\1a&H00&)\t(4567,4608,\1a&HFF&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}Captain "Black Cage" Hina\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(730,483)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Captain "Black Cage" Hina\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 3,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.90,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(730,483)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Captain "Black Cage" Hina\NMarine Headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what I get for helping you out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I might add, for\Nthe umpteenth time, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.19,0:10:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My elite unit found this ship for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thanks would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.74,0:10:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hina's upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't give me that speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all marines. Oh, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how poor Tashigi\Nputs up with you, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She manages somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.21,0:11:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to take this ship into HQ me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also Toshiki is going to\Nbe bringing crocodile here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill two birds with one\Nstone and take him with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.84,0:11:20.30,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(481,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}Downpour\NThe Rainmaking Ship\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.84,0:11:20.30,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(481,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Downpour\NThe Rainmaking Ship\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:11:15.84,0:11:20.30,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(481,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Downpour\NThe Rainmaking Ship\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.03,0:11:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an officer not your\Npersonal errand girl
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tails. You lose, errand girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that smoker
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.57,0:11:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought a few years of command would\Nchange you, but I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hina's disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your permission, we can capture\Nall the Straw Hats in one fell swoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:11:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Denied!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not allow you to\Nlay a hand on any of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.75,0:12:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're never going to get\Nanother chance like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're sitting ducks right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader, there was a sandstorm in Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still a war reward, as always, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how Yuba fared,\Nbut take my word for it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.29,0:12:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sandstorm is no match\Nfor my stubborn old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got his blood in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.81,0:12:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as I get treated,\NI'll head to Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.95,0:12:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.15,0:12:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't worry, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.71,0:12:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time in three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rain will end the rebellion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our foolish sons will come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going\Nto be stubborn, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuba is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ghost town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.13,0:13:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.53,0:13:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to dry up and die too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.27,0:13:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain has come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I told you, I knew\Nthat it would come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.23,0:13:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rain that falls in the kingdom\Nis more than just a physical one,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but also a symbolic one that washes away\Nthe bitter tears of its recent past.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, what\Nare you still doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.57,0:14:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Couran, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't sleep, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.25,0:14:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't want to sleep right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather watch the rain fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.13,0:14:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bebe, about Pell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was, without a doubt, the strongest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.57,0:15:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most loyal and dignified\Nwarrior I ever served with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish I could have said thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.41,0:15:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be greatly honored by that. Princess.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.00,0:15:21.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,670)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(979,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(937,979,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}The Following Day
