Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.42,0:15:27.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord4.5\fad(980,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\3a&H00&\t(938,980,\1a&H00&)\3c&H000000&\fscy90\fscx90}Tamarisk\NArabasta's Eastern Port
