Dialogue: 3,0:15:21.42,0:15:27.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\pos(720,590)\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\fad(980,0)\4a&HFF&\fscy90\fscx90}Tamarisk\NArabasta's Eastern Port
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.73,0:15:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hina, Sergeant Major Tashigi has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure has been a while, Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nina?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a little tired, so I'm\Ngoing to go get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.75,0:15:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back, Captain Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get my report? Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.85,0:15:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard about what happened\Nwith the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:15:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I helped the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:16:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also had an opportunity to\Ncapture them, and I let it slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My actions were shameful. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.27,0:16:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing? Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you follow your\Njustice like I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.31,0:16:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.51,0:16:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I didn't\Nhave any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.23,0:16:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice is only for\Nthe people who take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of world we live in, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me which way Crocodile went!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which way did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was charged with bringing Crocodile\Nin, but I wasn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Straw Hat Luffy asked where he\Nwas, all I could do was tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was also no match for Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.55,0:16:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.69,0:17:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there was no justice I could follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you were strong\Nenough to defeat Crocodile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.03,0:17:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.31,0:17:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Straw Hats stepped\Nup and did it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats know what you have\Nto do to survive in this sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You either step up or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did what you could\Nbut it wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.29,0:17:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Learn from this experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your permission, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get some\Nrest, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.79,0:17:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toshiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what the Straw Hats did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step up and become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wish the rest of you had the\Nsame kind of guts that she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, get those prisoners\Nloaded on this ship. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain HQ for you on the\Ntransponder snail this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.89,0:18:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is Marine Headquarters\Ncalling could I speak with?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker please\Nsmoker here congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on subduing Sir Crocodile\Ncaptain as a result The
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,top officials of the World\NGovernment have ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that both you and Sergeant\NMajor Tashigi Be given
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.79,0:18:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,medals for your efforts\Nsubduing no wait hold on a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minute we aren't the ones\Nwho took Down Crocodile it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was the Straw Hats did\Nanyone even bother to read
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the report furthermore as\NThanks for your gallantry,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's also been decided that each of\Nyou will be promoted by one rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:19:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you, for the\Numpteenth time, it wasn't us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.45,0:19:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me and Toshiki weren't the ones\Nwho stopped Crocodile and Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was those damn straw-hat pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop, Smoker, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.97,0:19:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's obvious at this point\Nthat the government's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to cover up this entire incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of the scandal if word of\Nwhat really happened got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta was almost toppled, and\Nit wasn't saved by the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but by a group of wanted pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.89,0:19:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we expect both of you to\Nattend the awards ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where your medals will\Nbe - Like hell we will!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.55,0:19:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoker, don't be dumb. Accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you disobey the brass, you\Ncould get court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, better that than live a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.89,0:19:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We didn't take Crocodile down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My subordinate's in tears\Nbecause we couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you pass on a personal message\Nfrom me to the old geezers at HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him I said go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.37,0:19:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your medicine-making skills are\Nso innovative and practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:19:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a genius, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.59,0:20:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where in the world did\Nyou learn such techniques?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony was a practicing\Ndoctor back in Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean the same drum that was once\Nrenowned for its advanced medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No wonder this little\Nfellow is so talented. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been a doctor for 40 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but even I don't know the\Ntechniques and remedies that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're far younger than I, but\Nit's obvious I'm no match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're clearly the superior doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravo, my boy! Shut up, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.03,0:20:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here or you're\Ngonna talk like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's offering me tea in a\Nchair despite what he's saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.35,0:20:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does he want me to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He certainly does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.49,0:20:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, show me\Nmore of your incredible talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.67,0:20:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.29,0:20:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could have splendid\Nskills such as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.11,0:20:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how impressed I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.79,0:21:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, does anybody have any more lumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm out too. I have some left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.75,0:21:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.79,0:21:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone's coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because their princess is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please. It is. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,House after house is like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.33,0:21:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.79,0:21:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Usad, what's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.01,0:21:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll improve my concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I can bring out that power any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.83,0:21:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't consider myself stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.05,0:21:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're all such interesting books.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.43,0:21:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to take some with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.43,0:21:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.34,0:21:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take any you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.41,0:21:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've read all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll definitely take\Nyou up on that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you a hundred\Ntimes, there are no pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lying to us will only harm your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.07,0:21:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harboring pirates is a major felony.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.97,0:21:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:21:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:21:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was surprised we were able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no evidence, and I\Ndon't see any pirates here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.03,0:22:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.61,0:22:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Luffy's woken up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.77,0:22:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.71,0:22:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things would be noisier if he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.44,0:22:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I slept good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.87,0:22:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.31,0:22:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is my hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.67,0:22:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my breakfast? My\Nhat! My breakfast! My hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.19,0:22:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just woke up, and you're\Nalready making a racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it won't be breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.35,0:22:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.31,0:22:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.22,0:22:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hat's right over there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.53,0:22:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, a soldier found\Nit near the front of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved you\Nfinally got well, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got well?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.24,0:22:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was never not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dummy, you were in really\Nbad shape and had a high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi and Chopper have been\Ntaking care of you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Luffy, you woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.85,0:22:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.07,0:22:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.11,0:22:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were out training, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't need your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.69,0:22:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.57,0:23:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are your bandages?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.89,0:23:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was too hard to move with them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.25,0:23:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.81,0:23:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably because it has been long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.05,0:23:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been asleep for three entire days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.93,0:23:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.89,0:23:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three whole days? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed 15 meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure calculate quickly\Nwhen it comes to food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.23,0:23:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By his count, that's\Nlike five meals a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the captain's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dinner will be served shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.61,0:23:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're all hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.06,0:23:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old tube-haired\Nguy, you're still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that cross-dressing\Nthing wasn't just an act.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everyone, you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.11,0:23:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Terracotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's Igaram's wife and the\Nhead of the palace's servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.07,0:23:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping Vivi and my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of wives resembling their\Nhusbands, but this is too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the captain eats a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.17,0:23:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I had my staff put together a little\Nsnack to tide you and your friends over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.89,0:23:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greedy pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.21,0:23:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat three whole\Ndays worth of food, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.39,0:23:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.91,0:24:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never lost to anyone's stomach,\Nso eat to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, it seems to be Pucci less.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.17,0:24:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with more manners too, I'm sure, this\Nis the Royal Dining Hall, not a trough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.23,0:24:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Captain, keep\Nit up, I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.37,0:24:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy, you just snatched\Nmy food, didn't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.13,0:24:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.57,0:24:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you keep eating like\Nthat, you're gonna choke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.33,0:24:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.59,0:24:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snatch my food, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.05,0:24:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some hot sauce will fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very right, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyelash, what did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you call that dish there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.19,0:24:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called kunafa, noodles\Nbaked in a brick oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.45,0:24:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.81,0:24:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's more. Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.13,0:24:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I never knew you were the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.47,0:24:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means you're\Nalso Evie's dad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.53,0:24:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.57,0:24:56.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, maybe we should talk after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.87,0:24:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then another round down here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And water down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.85,0:25:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're loud, uncouth, and disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.63,0:25:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say, I can't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.99,0:25:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.47,0:25:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could she keep laughing like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want something!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.77,0:25:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want something!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.06,0:25:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.01,0:25:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the palace's royal bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.43,0:25:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, we only use it\Nduring the rainy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.11,0:25:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm royally impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.35,0:25:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.31,0:25:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.95,0:25:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real mature, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.75,0:25:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was some\Ndinner tonight, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.27,0:25:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought an after-dinner bath\Nwould be a more sedative thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.19,0:26:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems anything you lads get\Ninvolved with becomes a party very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.49,0:26:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Look over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at what we're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.43,0:26:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're training!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.59,0:26:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.73,0:26:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey, where's the women's bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would I tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.03,0:26:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the princess is! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.39,0:26:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right behind that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.11,0:26:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.53,0:26:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks, old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.33,0:26:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This feels so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.99,0:26:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if a ship with a\Nbig bath like this exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.75,0:26:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea's full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.83,0:26:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of what we've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.49,0:26:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giants and dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.11,0:26:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blossoms blooming in a winter land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.51,0:26:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If those things exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.33,0:26:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there must be plenty of more\Namazing things out there in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.55,0:26:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess. My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.83,0:26:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.33,0:26:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.33,0:26:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.19,0:26:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.13,0:26:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll cost 100,000 berries each
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.65,0:26:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.65,0:27:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make up your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what better think quick I was\Nthinking we might actually leave here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.09,0:27:18.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tonight really yeah we need to go\Nall the goings good we know that the
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.83,0:27:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marines are looking all over for us\Nand that means the ship is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.39,0:27:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.30,0:27:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.91,0:27:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.13,0:27:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that we don't appreciate it,\Nbut a king is supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.15,0:27:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The swordsman is right, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.51,0:27:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're this land's sovereign ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.17,0:27:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should bow to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.47,0:27:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Igaram.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.69,0:27:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Authority is something that\Nyou wear over your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.35,0:28:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're in the bath now, and there is\Nno such thing as a naked king, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.07,0:28:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank all of you\Nfrom the bottom of my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.57,0:28:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as both a father and\Na native of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.43,0:28:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta will forever be\Nin your dead Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.95,0:28:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.69,0:28:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell you how\Nmuch we appreciate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.57,0:28:30.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marines know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.25,0:28:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More will be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.29,0:28:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get out now. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.57,0:28:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not just because\Nshe's got a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.63,0:28:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we should leave, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.13,0:28:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.04,0:28:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only after we've had\Nsome more yummy food.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.53,0:28:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, now, you idiot egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.31,0:28:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Igaram?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.01,0:28:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to let them know right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.19,0:28:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.01,0:28:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, word of what's happened\Nhere has traveled fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.15,0:28:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've already released new Wanted\Nposters, and the bounties are quite large.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.45,0:29:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roronoa Zoro, 60 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.81,0:29:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.97,0:29:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, 100 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.31,0:29:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.29,0:29:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With bounties like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.69,0:29:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marine Headquarters must have a keen\Ninterest in capturing the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.53,0:29:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no longer a mere pirate, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.93,0:29:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not since, you took down one of\Nthe Seven Warlords of the Sea.

